OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786234686
OL,3,CTemperatures to rise on Sunday as UK
OL,4,Cbraces for fifth heatwave
OL,6,FSunday is set to see some spells of
OL,7,Frain in Scotland, Northern Ireland,
OL,8,Fand northern England, and some
OL,9,Fisolated showers may break out in the
OL,10,FSouth East, according to the Met
OL,11,FOffice.
OL,13,FBut it will remain largely dry and
OL,14,Fsunny elsewhere, with temperatures set
OL,15,Fto reach the high 20s for most people.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
