OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786234686
OL,3,CTemperatures to rise on Sunday as UK
OL,4,Cbraces for fifth heatwave
OL,6,FThe south and south-eastern parts of
OL,7,Fthe UK could see temperatures climb
OL,8,Finto the 30s, potentially reaching up
OL,9,Fto 33C in the South East, the Met
OL,10,FOffice said.
OL,12,FAny wildfires are likely to be
OL,13,Fexceptionally severe on Sunday in
OL,14,Falmost all of the east and south-east
OL,15,Fof England, according to the Fire
OL,16,FSeverity Index. "Exceptional" severity
OL,17,Fis its highest ranking.
OL,26,@xD@QOUxD@]O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
