PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786234686
OL,3,CTemperatures to rise on Sunday as UK
OL,4,Cbraces for fifth heatwave
OL,6,FThe Met Office data includes rainfall,
OL,7,Ftemperature and humidity, and agencies
OL,8,Fuse the index to assess the severity
OL,9,Fof fire if it starts. It does not
OL,10,Fcover the chances of wildfires
OL,11,Foccurring.
OL,13,FThe UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA)
OL,14,Fhas issued yellow heat health alerts
OL,15,Ffor the East Midlands, West Midlands,
OL,16,FSouth East, South West, East of
OL,17,FEngland, Yorkshire and the Humber, and
OL,18,FLondon.
OL,20,FThe yellow heat health alerts are to
OL,21,Flast until 9pm on Tuesday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
