PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786234686
OL,3,CTemperatures to rise on Sunday as UK
OL,4,Cbraces for fifth heatwave
OL,6,FThey warn that the hot weather is
OL,7,Flikely to affect the wellbeing of the
OL,8,Fpopulation and put additional pressure
OL,9,Fon healthcare services.
OL,11,FThe Met Office said heatwave
OL,12,Fconditions will likely return next
OL,13,Fweek, with a high of 36C expected in
OL,14,Fparts of East Anglia and south-east
OL,15,FEngland by Thursday.
OL,17,FTwo record-breaking heatwaves in May
OL,18,Fand June led to more than 2,800 excess
OL,19,Fdeaths, and two more heatwaves in July
OL,20,Fhave fuelled drought and wildfires.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
