OL,3,CTemperatures to rise on Sunday as UK
OL,4,Cbraces for fifth heatwave
OL,6,FNineteen counties across England
OL,7,Frecorded effectively no rainfall ` 1mm
OL,8,For less ` across the whole of the
OL,9,Fmonth, Met Office figures show.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/11
